	)
	(text "USB_D-/USB_D+ connect to D2 below.\nPlace R3/R4 and C12/C13 near U1.\nRoute 90 ohm differential.\nC12/C13: reserved tuning caps; do not populate."
		(at 185.42 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "238a6483-8409-4c91-b298-15968ecbae38")
	)
	(text "First power-up: use a non-PD 5 V USB host.\nProgram and verify NVM before PD_RESET.\nReset can reboot ESP; re-verify on next boot.\nAllow >=30 ms after U2 reset release for I2C.\nPDO1 = 5 V / 1.5 A; PDO2 = 15 V / 2 A.\nTwo PDOs; USB_COMM_CAPABLE = 1;\nPOWER_ONLY_ABOVE_5V = 0; POWER_OK_CFG = 10b.\nI2C address 0x28 (ADDR0/ADDR1 grounded)."
		(at 271.78 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "030c8cd4-8776-4f0b-9ade-ffc315f4bcb2")
	)
	(text "Factory NVM may select 20 V if offered.\nDesign for VBUS <=21 V continuous.\nQ1 can turn on at 5 V before a PD contract.\nPD_PDO2_N is a contract flag, not live PG.\nIt can remain low after detach: read status.\nPump needs attach + 15 V contract + current,\nand PD_PDO2_N low; invalidate on faults/loss.\nDefault pump enable off during reset/power loss."
		(at 271.78 62.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "526090af-da48-4a3d-9cc6-ff6994c087e9")
	)
	(text "AO3401A gate limit: +/-12 V. D5 is MANDATORY.\nD5 = BZT52C8V2; cathode to source/VBUS.\nVGS approx -4.1 V at 5 V; about -8 V clamped.\nSub-mA zener current: verify actual clamp.\nRetained ST gate network; verify startup/inrush,\nESD/hot-plug and VGS/VDS on assembled PCB.\nC10 alone does not prove transient immunity.\nD2 clamp supply = +3V3, with local C11.\nR5/R6: 1206, >=0.5 W; 14 / 21 mA at 21 V."
		(at 271.78 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c460965a-44ee-4304-9f5b-b66fd37dffc6")
	)
	(text "Internal 3.3 V supply (AP63203 buck)"
		(at 299.72 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "53724716-33a3-4663-9f26-e6f4b3622ee9")
	)
	(text "Place C2/C3 beside U1 pin 3.\n+3V3 is supplied by U3 in the power section."
		(at 185.42 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2242066f-cb72-445e-88b3-2db10b31c790")
	)
	(text "All GND pins, including 61_1...61_8, join GND.\nKeep GPIO3, GPIO45 and GPIO46 unloaded.\nIO4: REG12_EN; IO5: PUMP_EN (default OFF).\nIO6: PUMP_IMON; IO7: PUMP_FLT_N.\nIO10: V12_SENSE (ADC1, calibrated ATTEN3)."
		(at 111.76 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "96ed0cfb-9432-4eec-ad53-02f5c7cfedbf")
	)
	(text "EN = VIN; FB = VOUT. Design load: 0.5 A.\nL1 provisional: verify short/recovery and heat.\nPlace C14/C15 at IN/GND; C18 at BST/SW.\nSmall SW loop; keep clear of ESP antenna.\nVBUS_SW caps: 25.0 uF nominal with U4.\nVerify inrush and capacitor DC-bias curves.\nInternal 12 V branch: U4, gated by IO4."
		(at 350.52 168.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f9c65680-1293-45e4-a5b2-707589f65560")
	)
	(text "One USB-C plug; U3 supplies internal 3.3 V.\nU4 supplies gated 12 V from VBUS_SW.\nAt 5 V: logic only; classify source allowance.\nBoth radios OFF until enough power granted.\nUSB configuration / Type-C current / PD.\nMeet host startup and suspend current limits.\nVBUS-side caps: 5.7 uF nominal before attach."
		(at 271.78 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd6026d0-e8c2-4e30-934b-c37ad6cf7fca")
	)
	(text "VBUS_SW feeds U3 and the gated U4 branch.\n21 V continuous input envelope.\nVBUS_SW caps: 25.0 uF nominal total.\nVerify Q1/C10 inrush with C14/C15/C19/C20.\nU4 enabled only after valid 15 V contract.\nU5 limits pump current; firmware timeouts required."
		(at 314.96 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cae5aaf7-103f-44c5-a5eb-6013328f3963")
	)
	(text "Internal 12 V pump supply (AP63200 buck)"
		(at 426.72 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7bf6192c-f857-402a-a72e-5557d94de4ee")
	)
	(text "IO4 / REG12_EN: default OFF via R17 (10k).\n12.0 V nominal: 280k / 20k; verify regulation and ripple.\nEnable only with valid attach, 15 V / 2 A contract and PDO2.\nConfirm calibrated V12_SENSE before enabling the pump.\nPlace C19/C20 at IN/GND, C21 at BST/SW; small hot loop.\nKeep L2 / SW away from antenna; check capacitor DC bias.\nEstimates: 25.0 uF VBUS_SW caps; 1.59 A input at upper ILIM."
		(at 426.72 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a97c2fdb-5197-4980-b9f8-a3463f8acee7")
	)
	(text "Pump switch / current limit (TPS259620 eFuse)"
		(at 426.72 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "59928a08-48aa-420d-8c66-596538d3bc85")
	)
	(text "IO5 / PUMP_EN default OFF via R18 (10k).\nILIM estimate: 1.48 A; provisional R19 = 604 ohms.\nFLT: thermal or ILM-short fault; not a stall signal.\nRequire maximum-run / startup / overcurrent timeouts.\nIMON: I = V / (G x R19); G = 656 uA/A typical; calibrate.\nC26 = 10 nF: estimated 4.2 V/ms, 3 ms ramp to 12 V.\nD7 at U5 OUT; thermal pad to GND with PCB vias."
		(at 426.72 250.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bf60e658-69eb-4d5b-aaec-a0c51c027700")
	)
